	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/mods_setup/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="The maps played: a mod's replace the stock maps\nit has. OK starts the game again with it."/>
		<string text="Off: landings never hurt in the campaign. Gametypes\nhave their own, in Arena Options."/>
		<string text="How health comes back in the campaign. Gametypes\nhave their own, in Arena Options."/>
		<string text="The clock in a multiplayer game's corner and on\nits scoreboard: the time left, or played."/>
		<string text="On a wider screen, keep the HUD in a 16:9 or 4:3\npart at the middle; the view stays wide."/>
		<string text="With one player, draw split screen's smaller HUD:\nmeters, motion sensor and messages."/>
		<string text="How fast the scoreboard fades in and out while\nBack (or Tab) is held."/>
		<string text="Spoken power item spawns, in any gametype; with\nthe clock, Halo 1: NHE's talking timer too."/>
		<string text="The callouts' voice: a folder of voices/, next\nto maps/."/>
	</strings>
